---
// EvolveBeyond Landing Page
---

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>EvolveBeyond — Beyond Evolution</title>
  <meta name="description" content="EvolveBeyond — Open source projects that evolve beyond the ordinary">
  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'><text y='.9em' font-size='90'>🦎</text></svg>">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
  <img src="/axolotl.png" alt="" class="bg-axolotl" aria-hidden="true">

  <nav class="nav">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a href="/" class="nav-logo">evolvebeyond</a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#values">Values</a>
        <a href="#roadmap">Roadmap</a>
        <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/EvolveBeyond">GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="bento">
    <div class="bento-row">
      <div class="cell cell-hero">
        <div class="hero-label">open source · intent-driven · beyond evolution</div>
        <h1>We build tools that <strong>evolve beyond</strong> what's possible.</h1>
        <p class="hero-desc">Our team selects projects where real change happens. Not incremental improvements — paradigm shifts. Each tool we build pushes open source further.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bento-row row-3">
      <div class="cell cell-value">
        <div class="cell-num">01</div>
        <h3>Paradigm shifts</h3>
        <p>We don't fix symptoms. We rethink the problem. If a tool can be improved by 10%, we ask if it should be replaced entirely.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cell cell-value">
        <div class="cell-num">02</div>
        <h3>Intent over mechanics</h3>
        <p>Declare what you want. Let the system figure out how. We build tools that focus on intent, not the plumbing underneath.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cell cell-value">
        <div class="cell-num">03</div>
        <h3>Open by default</h3>
        <p>Everything we build is open. Transparent development, community-driven, no vendor lock-in.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bento-row row-roadmap">
      <div class="cell cell-roadmap">
        <div class="cell-num">roadmap</div>
        <div class="roadmap-grid">
          <div class="roadmap-item">
            <div class="roadmap-dot roadmap-dot--active"></div>
            <div class="roadmap-year">2024</div>
            <h4>Founded</h4>
            <p>Started with a question: what if your data model could carry its own infrastructure policy?</p>
          </div>
          <div class="roadmap-item">
            <div class="roadmap-dot roadmap-dot--active"></div>
            <div class="roadmap-year">2025</div>
            <h4>Expanding</h4>
            <p>Applied intent-orientation to networking, infrastructure, and developer tools.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="roadmap-item">
            <div class="roadmap-dot roadmap-dot--active"></div>
            <div class="roadmap-year">2026</div>
            <h4>Building ecosystem</h4>
            <p>EVOID maturing. XRayMOD redefining proxy management. Creating an intent-driven ecosystem.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="roadmap-item">
            <div class="roadmap-dot"></div>
            <div class="roadmap-year">Future</div>
            <h4>Intent-Driven Everything</h4>
            <p>A world where developers declare what they want, and systems figure out how.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bento-row row-projects">
      <a href="https://github.com/EvolveBeyond/EVOID" class="cell cell-project">
        <div>
          <div class="project-name">EVOID</div>
          <div class="project-desc">Intent-Oriented Programming Runtime</div>
          <div class="project-meta">Python · v0.3.3</div>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/EvolveBeyond/XRayMOD" class="cell cell-project">
        <div>
          <div class="project-name">XRayMOD</div>
          <div class="project-desc">Modular proxy management panel</div>
          <div class="project-meta">TypeScript · React</div>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="bento-row row-projects">
      <a href="https://github.com/EvolveBeyond/NvPak" class="cell cell-project">
        <div>
          <div class="project-name">NvPak</div>
          <div class="project-desc">Zen-modernized Neovim configuration</div>
          <div class="project-meta">Lua · 104 ★</div>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/EvolveBeyond/EasyMQL" class="cell cell-project">
        <div>
          <div class="project-name">EasyMQL</div>
          <div class="project-desc">MetaTrader 5 indicator library</div>
          <div class="project-meta">MQL5</div>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="bento-row row-footer">
      <div class="cell cell-footer">
        <span>© 2026 EvolveBeyond</span>
        <div class="footer-links">
          <a href="https://github.com/EvolveBeyond">GitHub</a>
          <a href="https://evolvebeyond.github.io/EVOID/">EVOID Docs</a>
          <a href="mailto:pakrohk@gamil.com">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>

<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  :root {
    --bg: #0a0a0a;
    --fg: #e0e0e0;
    --fg-dim: #555;
    --border: #1a1a1a;
    --cell: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.85);
    --cell-hover: rgba(20, 20, 20, 0.9);
  }

  body {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--fg);
    line-height: 1.5;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  .bg-axolotl {
    position: fixed;
    top: 50%; left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 80vmin;
    height: 80vmin;
    opacity: 0.12;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
    object-fit: contain;
    filter: invert(1);
  }

  .nav {
    position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 48px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.7);
    backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
    z-index: 100;
  }
  .nav-inner {
    width: 100%; height: 100%;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .nav-logo {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--fg); text-decoration: none;
  }
  .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 1.25rem; }
  .nav-links a {
    color: var(--fg-dim); text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.75rem; transition: color 0.15s;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--fg); }

  .bento {
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 48px 0 0;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--border);
  }
  .bento-row { display: grid; gap: 1px; background: var(--border); }
  .cell {
    background: var(--cell);
    padding: 2.5rem;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  }

  .cell-hero {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    padding: 6rem 3rem;
    align-items: center; text-align: center;
  }
  .hero-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.6rem; text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em; color: var(--fg-dim);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; max-width: 650px;
  }
  .hero h1 strong { font-weight: 700; }
  .hero-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--fg-dim);
    max-width: 480px; line-height: 1.8; font-weight: 300;
  }

  .row-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  .cell-value { padding: 2rem; }
  .cell-num {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.6rem; color: var(--fg-dim); margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .cell-value h3 { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .cell-value p { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--fg-dim); line-height: 1.7; font-weight: 300; }

  .row-roadmap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .cell-roadmap { padding: 3rem; }
  .roadmap-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 2rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .roadmap-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--fg-dim); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .roadmap-dot--active { background: var(--fg); }
  .roadmap-year { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.6rem; color: var(--fg-dim); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .roadmap-item h4 { font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }
  .roadmap-item p { font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--fg-dim); line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 300; }

  .row-projects { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .cell-project {
    padding: 2rem; text-decoration: none; color: var(--fg);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .project-name { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }
  .project-desc { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--fg-dim); font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.6; }
  .project-meta { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.6rem; color: var(--fg-dim); margin-top: 1rem; }

  .row-footer { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .cell-footer { padding: 1.5rem 2rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--fg-dim); }
  .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 1.25rem; }
  .footer-links a { color: var(--fg-dim); text-decoration: none; }
  .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--fg); }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .row-3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .row-projects { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .roadmap-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .cell-hero { padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
    .nav-links { display: none; }
    .cell-footer { flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; text-align: center; }
  }
</style>
